      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Voice_of_AB/status/2009992311338611169",
      "text": "This is from Philippines.\n\nEvery vendor here must display Sanitary Permit + Health Certificates (renewed every 6 months) fire safety and other permits. Strict hygiene rules, clean water, gloves, waste management → result? Clean, safe, delicious street food you can trust.\n\nNow compare to India 🇮🇳\nDirty utensils, open drains, no gloves/hairnets, reused oil, questionable water… food that can make you seriously sick. @fssaiindia has rules on paper, but enforcement is weak  many vendors unregistered, inspections rare.",
